# Groceries

[groceries] := table
| item  | quantity | price |
|-------|----------|-------|
| apple | 2        | $3.30 |
| pear  | 4        | $4.30 |

[grocery_total] := sum(groceries, quantity * price)
[grocery_units] := sum(groceries, quantity)
[average_price] := grocery_total / grocery_units

Groceries will cost [grocery_total] for [grocery_units] items.

